title: Two source control actions with no pause between them (stage all, then commit): the second must not be lost without a word; git log must have the commit
folders: git-changes
expect-file: git-changes/.git/logs/HEAD :: commit: right after staging
forbid-log: script: ignoring

wait 3000
left changes
git stage
git commit right after staging
wait 2500
mark end
wait 500
quit
